73
00:04:08,700 --> 00:04:12,400
As they close and as leak channels and the pump

74
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:16,620
continue their resting work, the potential returns towards minus

75
00:04:16,620 --> 00:04:17,660
70 millivolts.

76
00:04:18,380 --> 00:04:20,240
Follow the graph once more.

77
00:04:20,960 --> 00:04:24,980
Rest at minus 70, pile out, a

78
